                        Used Flask for browsing, renting,
                        returning, and membership features,
                        with a MySQL database backend.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 4 -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title h5">
                        Campus Service Robot Feasibility Study
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Researched student attitudes toward
                        introducing service robots at
