                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Analyzed feedback about privacy,
                        safety, robot tasks, operational
                        limitations, and campus use cases.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 5 -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title h5">
                        Security Information and Event
                        Management (SIEM)
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Participated in a cybersecurity
                        research project examining SIEM
                        technology and organizational security.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Researched log management, threat
                        detection, incident response,
                        security monitoring, and implementation
                        challenges.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 6 -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title h5">
                        E-commerce Trust System
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Helped design a trust-based system
                        to evaluate e-commerce returns
                        and reduce fraudulent claims.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Contributed to scoring logic involving
                        return rates, disputes, verification,
                        transaction history, and behavioural
                        consistency.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 7 -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title h5">
                        Ontario Tech Trips Cloud Transition
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-muted">Terraform / Infrastructure as Code</p>
                    <p>
                        Developed a cloud transition proposal
                        using Terraform to improve scalability,
                        automation, disaster recovery, and
                        infrastructure management.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Explored automated resource provisioning,
                        version-controlled infrastructure,
                        multi-cloud support, and safer deployments.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</main>

